# UUID-DHT public bootstrap HomeURIs.
# On first start, if config-include/dht-seeds is missing, the node copies this
# file so a downloaded StandaloneHypergrid binary joins this overlay.
# One HomeURI per line. Lines starting with # or ;; are ignored.
# Not an OpenSim Include — [UuidDht] knobs stay in OpenSimDefaults / Robust.HG.
#
# Public seeds (207.180.199.55):
#   10001 — first seed
#   10000 — second seed
# Other grids bootstrap from these URLs. DHT is not on Robust private 8003.
#
# After join, the node rewrites dht-seeds: this server first, then admitted
# peers (up to MaxBootstrapSeeds). That file is the persistent peer list.
# Restart re-reads it. The routing table itself stays in RAM (contacts are
# re-proven on join). Do not persist k-buckets.
#
http://207.180.199.55:10001/
http://207.180.199.55:10000/
